      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just so quiet now. i walk into the kitchen and i still expect to see him there, but it's just... nothing. it's like the air in this house is different. heavier. i don't even know why i bother getting up in the morning. it feels like i'm just going through the motions of a life that isn't even mine anymore.",
